A caption's marker separator is a run, and none of it is content

```
> q

^   cap

![a](i.png)
^ 	second
.
<figure>
  <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  <figcaption>cap</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure>
  <img src="i.png" alt="a">
  <figcaption>	second</figcaption>
</figure>
```

```
> q

^   

![a](i.png)
^ 
.
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
<p>^</p>
<p><img src="i.png" alt="a">
^</p>
```
